    L11809 · Löwdin, P.-O. (1969). Some comments on the periodic system of the elements. *Int. J. Quantum Chem.* **3**(S3A), 331–334. — the challenge.
    L11810 · Löwdin, P.-O. (1950). On the non-orthogonality problem. *J. Chem. Phys.* **18**, 365. — the multiplier identity is an instance.
    L11815 · Madelung, E. (1936). *Die Mathematischen Hilfsmittel des Physikers*, 3rd ed. Springer. — the rule as a rule.
